  "question": {
    "text": "If the sum of the coefficients in the expansion of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><msup><mo>)</mo><mi>n</mi></msup></math>&nbsp;is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4096</mn><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;then the greatest coefficient in the expansion is _____."
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "924",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Sum of coefficients of the expression <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><msup><mo>)</mo><mi>n</mi></msup></math>&nbsp;is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4096</mn><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>12</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn></math>&nbsp;</p><p>Now greatest binomial coefficient of the expression<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><msup><mo>)</mo><mi>n</mi></msup></math> is the middle term&#39;s coefficient so&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>6</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mi>n</mi></mmultiscripts><mo>=</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>6</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>12</mn></mmultiscripts><mo>=</mo><mn>924</mn></math></p>"
  }
